# Watchlist consensus-pair rebase DRAFT — transcribed 2026-08-09 from the Pareto
# Shipping Daily 7 AUG 2026 p.1 share-price table (ONE daily, one vintage — the
# WORKFLOWS §Consensus-pair recapture discipline). NOT APPLIED: promotion is the
# owner's deliberate step (this retires the k-vintage-skew debt — the 8/09
# marks promotion collapsed pure-play k to ~1.00-1.04 partly on the stale pnav
# vintage, and the REFRESH_VINTAGE_SKEW test allowance retires with it).
# On promote: rebase price + consensus_pnav + consensus_fwd_pe TOGETHER into
# watchlist.yaml with as_of 2026-08-07; APPROX names keep flags (price+PE only);
# names ABSENT from Pareto's table (TEN / SB / CMDB / 2343 / GSL) keep their
# current basis untouched — their price leg rides prices_daily, not this table.
# kr-quoted rows (BRUT / CAPT / BWLP / MPCC) are transcribed AS PRINTED — apply
# the standing FX conversion at promote, same-day NOK/USD.

as_of: 2026-08-07
source: Pareto Shipping Daily 2026-08-07 (issue 520031), p.1 "Share prices"

